Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:31:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] pdh: path parsing, wildcard expansion, object enumeration,
 data sources

Implement PdhParseCounterPath/PdhParseInstanceName (A/W), PdhExpandWildCardPath
and PdhExpandCounterPath (wildcards * and ?, NOEXPAND flags), PdhEnumObjectItems,
PdhEnumObjects, PdhGetDefaultPerfObject/Counter over the built-in counter set,
PdhBindInputDataSource/PdhCloseLog/PdhGetLogFileType (CSV/TSV/BLG detection),
PdhConnectMachine (local only), PdhSetDefaultRealTimeDataSource argument check,
PdhValidatePathEx handle check, PdhIsRealTimeQuery, PdhVbAddCounter/OpenQuery/
IsGoodStatus. PdhMakeCounterPath omits the #index for index 0 / -1.
Remote machines return PDH_CANNOT_CONNECT_MACHINE; no network access.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

